===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately a {{borrowing|la|India|lang=lv|nocap=1}}, itself from {{etyl|grc|lv}} {{term|Ἰνδία|tr=India|lang=grc}}, from {{term|Ἰνδός||Indus River|tr=Indos|lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|peo|lv}} {{term|𐏃𐎡𐎯𐎢𐏁|tr=hi<sup>n</sup>dūš|lang=peo}} ({{etyl|fa|-}} {{term|هند|tr=Hend|lang=fa}}) from {{etyl|sa|lv}} {{term|सिन्धु||a river, stream|tr=síndhu|lang=sa}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{rfap|lang=lv}}

===Proper noun===
{{lv-proper noun|f|4th}}

# [[India]] {{gloss|[[country]] in [[southern]] [[Asia]], with [[New Delhi]] as its [[capital]]}}
#: '''''Indijas''' karogs'' — the flag of '''India'''
#: '''''Indijas''' subkontinents'' — the '''Indian''' subcontinent
#: '''''Indija''' ir septītā lielākā valsts pasaulē'' — '''India''' is the seventh largest country in the world
#: '''''Indijai''' piemīt nozīmīga bioloģiskā daudzveidība'' — '''India''' has significant biological diversity

